+      { q: 'Can DIGI-TEC service my specific Mercedes model?', a: 'Send the model and year, mileage and requested work so the team can confirm acceptance, parts and procedures for the exact vehicle. C-Class, E-Class, S-Class, SUVs, G-Class and AMG models have different requirements. Hybrid and electric vehicles need separate scope confirmation; combustion-engine oil servicing does not apply to every Mercedes.' },
